@startuml
title RF60 — Depth chart · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MoraleEngine" as MoraleEngine
control "ClubAnalyst" as ClubAnalyst
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
Manager -> Frontend: abre depth chart
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/depth-chart
API -> UseCase: GetDepthChartUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: depth chart, elenco, relatório de lesões
alt não é dono
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED)
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  UseCase --> API: DepthChartView
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Manager -> Frontend: reordena e salva
Frontend -> API: PUT /careers/{id}/depth-chart
API -> UseCase: UpdateDepthChartUseCase
UseCase -> Redis: partida LIVE?
UseCase -> ClubAnalyst: valida slots, disponibilidade, fora de posição
ClubAnalyst --> UseCase: violações e avisos
alt partida LIVE / versão velha / incompleto / indisponível
  API --> Frontend: 422 / 409 + violações
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: TX: slots, version+1, special_teams_unit
  UseCase -> MoraleEngine: titulares rebaixados
  UseCase -> EventBus: DepthChartChanged
  EventBus -> Redis: DEL dashboard
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
@enduml
